rity, who has been restrained.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_18","text":"I recently obtained des information that someone has been stealing the Big Three's important technologies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_19","text":"But it was merely circonstanciels evidence, so I was not worried.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_20","text":"As it happened, you came to me to proposer le manufacturers' expo and Coin Rush Showdown to be held at Coin Rush.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_21","text":"The timing was idéal, so naturally, I décidé to rent Coin Rush to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_22","text":"Ultimately, I'm glad we managed to appréhender you, but I'm afraid I have let les chéries down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_23","text":"I'll arrange a separate occasion to explain what happened and apologize to them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_24","text":"... What? I'm the only one who got left out of the loop?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_25","text":"Well, the fewer people who knew, the better.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_26","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_27","text":"Haha. Looks like you aren't respected even among your fellow CEOs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_28","text":"What did you just say?! Huh?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:e