anning to sell it to one of us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_36","text":"None of us would be interested in buying technology that's been stolen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_37","text":"Did you foolishly expect one of us to buy something that's nothing but a liability?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_38","text":"Or what? Were you gonna find some other client in the Ark to sell it to?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_39","text":"Ha! Who'd be dumb enough to cross the Big Three just to buy that information from you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_40","text":"The Ark is really small, you know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_