","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_66","text":"... You could've lived a comfortable life even without resorting to this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_67","text":"You're a high-ranking official of the Central Government. Why would you do such a thing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_68","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_69","text":"The Ark will go down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_70","text":"That's why.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_71","text":"... Who's behind this? Who were you going to sell the information to?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_72","text":"Do you really think I'll tell you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_73","text":"Not really. Well, we have all the time in the world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_74","text":"I'll take my time and wring the answer out of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_75","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_76","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_76","text":"... What were your elite guards wearing underneath their clothes?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_77","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_77","text":"I was told that your guards had superhuman strength.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_78","text":"The bunny girl suits that you love so much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_79","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_79","text":"... Now you're pissing me off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_80","text":"Ha! I bet they're just cheap replicas of Missilis's wearable tech.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_81","text":"You know what?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_82","text":"Every guard of yours who was wearing it has been crippled.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_83","text":"!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_84","text":"Every last one of them wound up unable to use some parts of their body. Permanently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_85","text":"Their nerves are completely shot. Nothing can be done to treat them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_86","text":"The imitation wearable tech is completely trashed, too. There's no way to extract any information from it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_87","text":"... Is that so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_88","text":"See? This is why you should use proper technology. This is what happens when you settle for cheap imitations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_89","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_90","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_90","text":"... The head of security falls quiet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_91","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_91","text":"For a long while, a heavy silence hangs over the room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_92","text":"... Seems like you're not in the mood to talk anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_93","text":"No matter. We will uncover the details as the investigation proceeds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_94","text":"Wait, wait. I have one last thing I want to ask.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_95","text":"Why were you so hell-bent on targeting Missilis? You made us out to be the villain and turned us into a laughingstock.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_96","text":"Do you have some kind of grudge against me? Who even are you? Do I know you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_97","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_98","text":"You...! You don't even remember me...?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_99","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_100","text":"... No?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_101","text":"... Damn it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_102","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_103","text":"A few years ago, I had an opportunity to give you a presentation on my wearable tech.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_104","text":"Since I was just some nobody at a small tech company back then, I saw it as a golden opportunity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_105","text":"I thought my worth had finally been recognized, and I spent sleepless nights preparing for the presentation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_106","text":"I was confident, so I got my hopes up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_107","text":"If things went well, I could become a researcher at Missilis or sell you my technology.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_108","text":"The presentation wasn't bad. In fact, it went pretty well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_109","text":"But at the end of my presentation...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_110","text":"You said it was barely worth the dirt under Missilis's toenails!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"MissilisOffice","bgArt":"missilisoffice","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_111","text":"\"Give him some money and get him out of here.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_112","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mustang","ingrid"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_113","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_113","text":"You're unbelievable...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_114","text":"Sure, I get it. My technology may be terrible, and you might not like it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_115","text":"But you didn't need to crush my pride like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_116","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_117","text":"I used that humiliation as fuel and clawed my way up, eventually securing a high-ranking position in the Central Government.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_118","text":"... All this time, I've been waiting to get my revenge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_119","text":"So I carried out my plan during Coin Rush Showdown.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_120","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_120","text":"I wanted to humiliate you the way you humiliated me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_121","text":"How foolish. Things could've gone much more smoothly for you if you hadn't done that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_122","text":"... I admit that, yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_123","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_123","text":"I was consumed by my desire to avenge my past humiliation that I ended up ruining everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_124","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_124","text":"... I remember.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_125","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_125","text":"I remember you now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_126","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_126","text":"Ha, am I supposed to thank you for finally remembering me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_127","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_06_s_127","text":"Hey! After all that praise I gave you, this is how you repay me?!","jump":null,